| 11    | 30            | 7       | 162    | $12,798| $153,576   |
| 12    | 35            | 8       | 189    | $14,931| $179,172   |

**Year 1 Totals:**
- **Total MRR at Month 12:** $14,931
- **Annualized Run Rate:** $179,172
- **Estimated Annual Revenue:** ~$95,000 (cumulative)
- **Secondary Revenue (templates/consulting):** ~$5,000

---

## 5. IMPLEMENTATION CHECKLIST

### Week 1-2: Foundation
- [ ] Set up Stripe account + test mode
- [ ] Configure 3 subscription products in Stripe Dashboard
- [ ] Create hosted checkout pages
- [ ] Set up webhook endpoint (can use Stripe CLI for local testing)

### Week 3-4: Integration
- [ ] Connect Stripe webhooks to your app
- [ ] Implement customer portal for self-service upgrades/cancellations
- [ ] Set up trial period (14 days, no card required for lead gen)
- [ ] Configure dunning/failed payment emails

### Week 5: Launch Prep
- [ ] Create pricing page with clear tier comparison
- [ ] Set up analytics (track conversion rates)
- [ ] Prepare 3 onboarding email templates
- [ ] Test full payment flow end-to-end

---

## 6. KEY METRICS TO TRACK

| Metric                     | Target | Why                          |
|----------------------------|--------|------------------------------|
| Conversion Rate (Trial->Paid) | >25%   | Product-market fit indicator |
| Monthly Churn              | <7%    | Retention health             |
| LTV:CAC                    | >3:1   | Sustainable growth           |
| MRR Growth Rate            | 10-15%/mo | Early traction             |

---

## SUMMARY

**Best-fit model:** Simple 3-tier monthly subscription ($29/$79/$149)

**Secondary streams:** Template pack ($49 one-time) + optional setup call ($199)

**Payment stack:** Stripe only - use hosted checkout, webhooks, and customer portal

**12-month goal:** ~$15k MRR with ~200 active customers

**Solo-founder advantage:** This model requires zero billing infrastructure, predictable revenue, and scales without adding complexity.

---

